to-info__title heading-serif\">Información</h2><div class=\"contacto-info__block\"><span class=\"contacto-info__heading label-caps\">Horario</span><p class=\"contacto-info__text\">Lunes a viernes<br/>de 8:00 h a 17:00 h</p></div><div class=\"contacto-info__block\"><span class=\"contacto-info__heading label-caps\">Dónde estamos</span><p class=\"contacto-info__text\">Las Palmas de Gran Canaria</p></div><div class=\"contacto-info__block\"><span class=\"contacto-info__heading label-caps\">Contacto directo</span><p class=\"contacto-info__text\"><a href=\"tel:+34654184933\" class=\"contacto-info__link\">654 18 49 33</a><br/><a href=\"mailto:creanogal@gmail.com\" class=\"contacto-info__link\">creanogal@gmail.com</a></p></div><p class=\"contacto-info__pitch\">¿Tienes un negocio y quieres reformarlo? Escríbenos y te damos atención personalizada.</p></aside><div class=\"contacto-form-wrap\"><h2 class=\"contacto-form-wrap__title heading-serif\">Escríbenos</h2><p class=\"contacto-form-wrap__subtitle\">Rellena el formulario y te preparamos un presupuesto a medida.</p><form class=\"contact-form\" noValidate=\"\"><div class=\"contact-form__row\"><label class=\"contact-form__field\"><span class=\"contact-form__label\">Nombre*</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"contact-form__input\" placeholder=\"Tu nombre\" autoComplete=\"name\" required=\"\" value=\"\"/></label><label class=\"contact-form__field\"><span class=\"contact-form__label\">Teléfono</span><input type=\"tel\" class=\"contact-form__input\" placeholder=\"Tu teléfono\" autoComplete=\"tel\" value=\"\"/></label></div><label class=\"contact-form__field\"><span class=\"contact-form__label\">Email*</span><input type=\"email\" class=\"contact-form__input\" placeholder=\"tucorreo@ejemplo.com\" autoComplete=\"email\" required=\"\" value=\"\"/></label><label class=\"contact-form__field\"><span class=\"contact-form__label\">¿En qué podemos ayudarte?</span><select class=\"contact-form__input contact-form__select\"><option value=\"Cocina